ears. Usually, his expression is indifferent and have few emotional fluctuations. In fact, he hides the side of a child (such as he loves cats and sweets).\nSide (158cm): A specter who has been floating since his death. Often have serious expression, and is implicit tsundere, easy to get lost. He always feels reluctant about some of Blanke's behaviors.\n\n\u25cbRequest \nPlease draw illustration according to their setting. \n*Optional Element reference: Night mansion, French windows, cemeteries, bats, coffins decorated with flowers, retro streets, Fog city street etc.\n\nThank you so much for considering! It doesn't matter if you feel inappropriate, you can cancel this request.", "nc": 128, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}, {"path": "/@takoyaki_osusi/works/6", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 1331975, "client_id": 2959888, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/ab136561/uploads/origins/129fdeff-c340-49fe-8e80-e12626a58740?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=dc7eefacd8be8c99481e8cb64163ba74", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/ab136561/uploads/origins/129fdeff-c340-49fe-8e80-e12626a58740?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=dc7eefacd8be8c99481e8cb64163ba74, https://si.imgix.net/ab136561/uploads/origins/129fdeff-c340-49fe-8e80-e12626a58740?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=b6bf24367bde27a44ff9e17d7bd8e862 2x, https://si.imgix.net/ab136561/uploads/origins/129fdeff-c340-49fe-8e80-e12626a58740?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=6f4da0aed740f41f92e9a928f2339326 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/ab136561/uploads/origins/129fdeff-c340-49fe-8e80-e12626a58740?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompr